{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4EXEK2QTBKHWRM9S62PXC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このぺーは、いつもと違うんです。\nぺーのファンの方は分かりますよね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"|ω･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"|ω･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです＼(^o^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"片方耳かけのぺー です!!!! "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単でしたか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい(-人-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺーは妹さんと仲良しで、ぺーと妹さんが遊びに行った話を聞くのが楽しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は京都に旅行したいな〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっかーに誕生日プレゼントをもらいました＼(^o^)/＼(^o^)/"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4EYTDJF6A3EWWRZ6XH3NT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n中身は、絵に書いたような飴かわいい飴でした!\n食べる時また写真を載せますね❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく百円ショップで大きな渦巻き飴を食べてたことを思い出しました。\nピンクがオススメです。食べてみてほしい〜＼(^o^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にオフショット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブランコ!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4EZWVJAKJ5KX8MZXQP5G0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n何年ぶりかな\nめちゃくちゃこぎました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}